                  "id": "seo-1-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep your truck running at its best by utilizing the truck service specials at Rechtien International Trucks. Routine maintenance is crucial to extending the life and performance of your truck, and service coupons make it easier than ever to stay on schedule and go the distance. Whether you need heavy duty truck repair or International truck service, Rechtien International Trucks has service discounts you can depend on. Take advantage of these great service deals and <a href=\"/service#appointment\">schedule service</a> with us today!",
