                  "id": "seo-2-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why choose Rechtien? Commercial trucks require expert service, relying on certified technicians qualified to tackle a range of unique repair and service needs. Our five South Florida locations are here to help truck drivers all around South Florida and beyond get the care they need to get back on the road in no time. Our <a href=\"/service\">service department</a> offers a wide range of service coupons for:",
