                    "text": "Browse our truck service specials today.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "seo-3-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not only do we offer unbeatable heavy duty truck repair and service, we use high-quality OEM parts for every job, ensuring an exact fit every time. Our rotating parts specials help you save even more, avoiding third-party manufacturer parts that can't hold up to the performance of OEM components. Staying up to date with your truck maintenance schedule is one of our top safe driving tips, so if you're in need of International truck service or repair, don't delay. Use our service discounts for superior care to keep you going for the long haul. Contact us today!",
